#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/tools/clang-tidy.rst:15
msgid "Clang-Tidy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/tools/clang-tidy.rst:17
msgid ""
"**Clang-Tidy** is a clang-based C++ \"linter\" tool. Its purpose is to "
"provide an extensible framework for diagnosing and fixing typical "
"programming errors, like style violations, interface misuse, or bugs that "
"can be deduced via static analysis. Official page can be found `here  "
"<https://clang.llvm.org/extra/clang-tidy>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/tools/clang-tidy.rst:24
msgid "Contents"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/tools/clang-tidy.rst:27
msgid "Features"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../advanced/static-code-analysis/tools/clang-tidy.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Clang-Tidy** supports a large variety of static checks that may not be "
"covered by the compiler itself. These checks are static analysis checks that "
"can be performed at a source code level."
msgstr ""

